    "Id": "chassisdef_bloodhound_B1-HND",
    "Name": "Bloodhound",
    "Details": "Intended for combating guerrilla units, the Bloodhound is armed with three ER medium lasers and a Streak SRM-6 launcher as its primary weapons. The Bloodhound carries a ER small laser as a secondary weapon. To dissipate the heat from the Bloodhound's weapons the 'Mech has 14 double heat sinks. For its intended mission and in an infantry support role the Bloodhound is a superb 'Mech, but when facing other 'Mechs the Bloodhound is woefully underarmed.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Improved Sensors</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.03</color></b>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_bloodhound"
